1,"Oloma Language (OLM) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/olm/,"Oloma is an endangered indigenous language of Nigeria. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Oloma,Niger-Congo
