3,Oloma language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/oloma_language,"Oloma is a Northwestern Edoid language spoken by a small community in Edo State, southern Nigeria, with an estimated 300 speakers who use it as their primary language. Classified within the Niger-Cong.",Oloma,Niger-Congo
